---
// P2A readings only. Bars use a fixed 0.80–1.40 scale so 0.95 and 1.00 stay comparable.
// No radio control: every state stays visible, and a control that only drew a border is omitted.
const zh = !Astro.url.pathname.includes('/en/')
const cards = zh
  ? [
      { id: 'open', title: '开仓，预言机价 4,000', approx: '约 1.32', exact: '1.319999677920078588', pos: '86.7%', meter: true, zone: '大于 1，不能清算', price: '4,000', collateral: '1 WETH', debt: '2,500.000610' },
      { id: 'drop', title: '跌到 2,800，还没人清算', approx: '约 0.924', exact: '0.923999549827419324', pos: '20.7%', meter: true, zone: '小于 1，且不超过 0.95，最多可清 100%', price: '2,800', collateral: '仍是 1 WETH', debt: '2,500.001218' },
      { id: 'liq', title: '有人调用清算之后', approx: '债务为 0', exact: '', pos: '0%', meter: false, zone: '抵押品在这一笔里才转移', price: '2,800', collateral: '失去 0.9375009135 WETH', debt: '0' },
      { id: 'repay', title: '先还 750，再跌到同一个 2,800', approx: '约 1.32', exact: '1.319998301350757347', pos: '86.7%', meter: true, zone: '大于 1，错误码 45，不能清算', price: '2,800', collateral: '仍是 1 WETH', debt: '1,750.002252' },
      { id: 'half', title: '只跌到 2,950', approx: '约 0.973', exact: '0.973499525711031074', pos: '28.9%', meter: true, zone: '小于 1，但高于 0.95，最多 50%', price: '2,950', collateral: '清算前仍是 1 WETH', debt: '2,500.001218' }
    ]
  : [
      { id: 'open', title: 'Open, oracle price 4,000', approx: 'about 1.32', exact: '1.319999677920078588', pos: '86.7%', meter: true, zone: 'Above 1. Liquidation is refused.', price: '4,000', collateral: '1 WETH', debt: '2,500.000610' },
      { id: 'drop', title: 'Price 2,800, before liquidation', approx: 'about 0.924', exact: '0.923999549827419324', pos: '20.7%', meter: true, zone: 'Below 1 and at or below 0.95. The cap is 100%.', price: '2,800', collateral: 'still 1 WETH', debt: '2,500.001218' },
      { id: 'liq', title: 'After the liquidation call', approx: 'Debt is 0', exact: '', pos: '0%', meter: false, zone: 'Collateral moves in this transaction.', price: '2,800', collateral: '0.9375009135 WETH leaves', debt: '0' },
      { id: 'repay', title: 'Repay 750, then the same 2,800', approx: 'about 1.32', exact: '1.319998301350757347', pos: '86.7%', meter: true, zone: 'Above 1. Error 45. Liquidation is refused.', price: '2,800', collateral: 'still 1 WETH', debt: '1,750.002252' },
      { id: 'half', title: 'Price only falls to 2,950', approx: 'about 0.973', exact: '0.973499525711031074', pos: '28.9%', meter: true, zone: 'Below 1 and above 0.95. The cap is 50%.', price: '2,950', collateral: 'still 1 WETH before the call', debt: '2,500.001218' }
    ]
---
<figure class="scene">
  <div class="scene-set">
    <p class="scene-legend">{zh ? '同一次开仓快照。横条范围是健康因子 0.80 到 1.40。琥珀线是 0.95，珊瑚色线是 1.00。线的右边（大于或等于 1）不能清算。' : 'One open-position snapshot. Each bar maps health factor 0.80 to 1.40. The amber mark is 0.95. The coral mark is 1.00. At or above 1, liquidation is refused.'}</p>
    <div class="hf-key" aria-hidden="true">
      <span><i class="tick-swatch tick-95"></i>{zh ? '0.95：此部署全额上限的分界' : '0.95: full-close boundary on this deployment'}</span>
      <span><i class="tick-swatch tick-1"></i>{zh ? '1.00：小于它才可清算' : '1.00: liquidation needs a value below this'}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="scene-grid">
      {cards.map((card) => (
        <article class="scene-card">
          <h3 class="scene-title">{card.title}</h3>
          <p class="scene-hf"><span>{zh ? '健康因子' : 'Health factor'}</span> <strong>{card.approx}</strong></p>
          {card.exact && <p class="scene-exact"><span class="visually-hidden">{zh ? '精确读数' : 'Exact reading'} </span>{card.exact}</p>}
          {card.meter ? (
            <div class="hf-track" role="img" aria-label={zh
              ? `健康因子 ${card.approx}，刻度从 0.80 到 1.40，标出 0.95 和 1`
              : `Health factor ${card.approx} on a scale from 0.80 to 1.40, with marks at 0.95 and 1`}>
              <span class="hf-fill" style={`--pos: ${card.pos}`}></span>
              <span class="hf-tick tick-95"></span>
              <span class="hf-tick tick-1"></span>
            </div>
          ) : <p class="scene-empty">{zh ? '没有债务时不再用这条刻度。' : 'With no debt, this scale is not used.'}</p>}
          <dl class="scene-dl">
            <dt>{zh ? '预言机价' : 'Oracle price'}</dt><dd>{card.price}</dd>
            <dt>{zh ? '抵押品' : 'Collateral'}</dt><dd>{card.collateral}</dd>
            <dt>{zh ? '债务' : 'Debt'}</dt><dd>{card.debt}</dd>
          </dl>
          <p>{card.zone}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>{zh ? '图 17-1｜' : 'Figure 17-1 · '}</strong>
    {zh
      ? '同一价格 2,800 下，不还款时健康因子约 0.924，抵押仍是 1 WETH；先还 750 后健康因子约 1.32，债务约 1,750。这些是第 17 章的读数。'
      : 'At the same oracle price, 2,800, the unpaid health factor is about 0.924 and collateral is still 1 WETH. After repaying 750, the health factor is about 1.32 and the debt is about 1,750. These are the Chapter 17 readings.'}
  </figcaption>
</figure>
